The multishot code (which contains the racial multishot
bonus) is located in dothrow.c, in the throw_obj function.

I implemented a similar YANI in dnethack: the Longbow of
Diana grants a +1 multishot bonus to all characters
(making it on par with the racial bows) and grants a
further +1 multishot bonus to Rangers (making it
superior to the racial bows). In addition, I implemented
a YANI from nethackwiki, giving it unlimited range.

One example of an artifact who's base type varies is
the Noble patch, which I recently posted to my github
account. The base type of both the Vestment of Hell and
the Mantle of Heaven change from game to game, according
to which of the cloaks has been assigned the opera cloak
and ornamental cope appearances.
